        },
        "quote": "(a) Any subdivider, developer or other property owner who plans to restrict a subdivision’s electrical services to underground wiring shall be required to pay any costs of streetlight installation which are above the standard costs for streetlight installations. Standard streetlight installation costs shall be construed to mean the costs of installing a streetlight in the subject subdivision if overhead wiring were available.",
